    "All twelve outside-pair continuations in the three new consumers reuse existing source contracts.",
    "Both critical-chain boundaries lie in the Kempe co-closure of genuine complete source colourings.",
    "Eleven finite stage laws compose through earlier stages and exact symbolic triangle reconstruction.",
    "Paired component choices retain the same exterior matching.",
    "Under explicit exterior Kempe closure and an initial trace, reconstructed source and exterior colourings agree at all eleven ports.",
